DEITIES AND ALLEGIANCE (PRIVATE PLAYTEST)
A DM can assign an existing saved character to a numbered deity (1-16).
ID 0 means no assigned deity. Worship is currently a social action and
cannot change your allegiance. Deity names have not been configured.

Planned: characters with a confirmed deity may sacrifice a monster corpse.
Sacrifice will release its loot to the room, consuming the corpse once.
This action and deity favor rewards are NOT available in this build.
See help corpse for current development status.
